@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = PASTE_JWT_FROM_LOGIN
@propertyId = 1
@stayId = 1
@groupCode = GR-REPLACE

### Login (copy token into @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@pms.local","password":"Demo@12345"}

### List buildings
GET {{host}}/api/buildings?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tariffs
GET {{host}}/api/rate-plans?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Waitlist
POST {{host}}/api/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"propertyId":1,"guestName":"Khách chờ phòng","phone":"0900000000","checkInDate":"2026-11-06","checkOutDate":"2026-11-07","roomTypeId":null,"note":"Demo"}

### Create group (replace with available room IDs)
POST {{host}}/api/group-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"propertyId":1,"guestName":"Đoàn công ty","phone":"0900000011","checkInDate":"2026-11-06","checkOutDate":"2026-11-07","roomIds":[8,9],"bookingSource":"DIRECT","note":"demo"}

### Group list
GET {{host}}/api/groups?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Debt list
GET {{host}}/api/debts?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock ledger
GET {{host}}/api/stock/movements?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Chain report
GET {{host}}/api/reports/chain?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agency report
GET {{host}}/api/reports/agencies?propertyId={{propertyId}}&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cash shifts
GET {{host}}/api/shifts?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registration CSV
GET {{host}}/api/reports/registration-csv?propertyId={{propertyId}}&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
